      <li><a href="https://www.issaonline.com/blogs/business/how-much-should-i-charge-for-online-personal-training" rel="noopener">ISSA: How much should I charge for online personal training?</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://stripe.com/pricing" rel="noopener">Stripe: Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://squareup.com/help/us/en/article/5068-square-s-payment-processing-fees-and-pricing" rel="noopener">Square: Learn about Square fees</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
